@startuml
hide empty description
[*] --> INACTIVE

state INACTIVE
state ENTRY_CONFIRM
state ACTIVE
state EXPORT_HOLD
state BAND_LIMIT

INACTIVE --> INACTIVE : prerequisite false\n/ reset(reason)
INACTIVE --> ENTRY_CONFIRM : eligible_now\nnear_limit | high_soc | full_or_idle
ENTRY_CONFIRM --> ENTRY_CONFIRM : new distinct observation\nentry_progress += elapsed
ENTRY_CONFIRM --> ACTIVE : entry_progress >= confirm\n/ active=true; reason=classified branch
ENTRY_CONFIRM --> INACTIVE : eligibility lost before confirm
ACTIVE --> ACTIVE : eligible_now\n/ hold := configured hold
ACTIVE --> EXPORT_HOLD : !eligible_now && SOC >= exit && hold > 0
EXPORT_HOLD --> EXPORT_HOLD : distinct observation\n/ decrement hold only by fresh elapsed
EXPORT_HOLD --> ACTIVE : eligible_now
EXPORT_HOLD --> BAND_LIMIT : hold exhausted && SOC >= exit
ACTIVE --> BAND_LIMIT : !eligible_now && SOC >= exit && no hold
BAND_LIMIT --> ACTIVE : eligible_now
ACTIVE --> INACTIVE : SOC < high-SOC exit\n/ HIGH_SMA_SOC_EXIT
EXPORT_HOLD --> INACTIVE : SOC < high-SOC exit
BAND_LIMIT --> INACTIVE : SOC < high-SOC exit

note right of ENTRY_CONFIRM
Eligibility branch precedence:
1 FULL_OR_IDLE
2 NEAR_LIMIT + HIGH_SOC
3 HIGH_SOC
4 NEAR_LIMIT

Confirmation uses monotonic time AND
fresh/distinct grid + primary observations.
A host stall is not credited as many samples.
end note

note right of ACTIVE
Harvest is not current_mode.
It selects/changes the charge baseline
inside AUTO charging.
end note
@enduml
